      "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* adds e2e api tests for attacking mangement apis by @akshaydeo in https://github.com/maximhq/bifrost/pull/7858\r\n* backport: cap zstd decoder memory (#5782) by @akshaydeo in https://github.com/maximhq/bifrost/pull/7859\r\n* test fixes regarding thinking token drop by @akshaydeo in https://github.com/maximhq/bifrost/pull/8016\r\n* convert params flow for compat plugin by @akshaydeo in https://github.com/maximhq/bifrost/pull/8015\r\n* message level output config support by @akshaydeo in https://github.com/maximhq/bifrost/pull/8018\r\n* 2.2.6 changelogs by @akshaydeo in https://github.com/maximhq/bifrost/pull/8014\r\n* test case fixes to cover the setup token by @akshaydeo in https://github.com/maximhq/bifrost/pull/8019\r\n* race fix for skill provider by @akshaydeo in https://github.com/maximhq/bifrost/pull/8020\r\n* token fix for e2e api fixes by @akshaydeo in https://github.com/maximhq/bifrost/pull/8034\r\n* concurrency test for streaming by @akshaydeo in https://github.com/maximhq/bifrost/pull/8035\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/maximhq/bifrost/compare/ent-v2.2.5-base...ent-v2.2.6-base",
